"Sussu's system in Esebus is built for the greatest possible extraction."
"Sussu's bracelets hold Esebus's leadership tokens and books; they make soldiers snap to and gates open."
"Sussu's vault in Esebus holds about thirty doomsday weapons."
"Later, the Heirs land secretly on the Esebus coast, kill Sussu and loot her vault."
"Later, the Heirs kill Badud, Ogarius and Amoh in central Esebus, their first deed."
"Later, Garna and Ushia usurp Esebus and announce a \"continuity council\"; few die in the overthrow."
"Later, a new Questor contests the takeover of Esebus and is killed."
"Later, Esebus belongs to the Questor Garna, who promises to improve Kankus."
"Later, killing Badud's grid gives Sarya's grid a claim to enter Esebus."
